    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this bright and beautifully presented two-bedroom, ground-floor apartment to the market, ideally positioned within the ever-popular Barnwall Court development in Balbriggan, Co. Dublin. No. 53 comes to the market in turnkey condition throughout and is currently owner occupied with no onward chain. This superb property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers, including first-time purchasers, those looking to trade down, and investors alike.\n\nThe location is second to none, situated within easy reach of Balbriggan Town Centre and an abundance of local amenities including reputable schools, shops, cafés, parks, beaches and sporting facilities. The area is well serviced by public transport, with Balbriggan Train Station and frequent bus routes nearby, while the M1 motorway provides swift access to Dublin Airport, Dublin City Centre and beyond.\n\nBright and well laid out internal living accommodation of c. 64 sq.m comprises of entrance hallway, spacious open-plan kitchen/living/dining area, two generous double bedrooms and main family bathroom. Both bedrooms benefit from fitted wardrobes, while the impressive living area enjoys an abundance of natural light and overlooks the well-maintained communal green areas.\n\nNo. 53 is presented in turnkey condition throughout and benefits from laminate flooring, double-glazed windows and gas-fired central heating. The fully fitted kitchen comes complete with ample storage and an electric hob, while the main bathroom is fully tiled and features a bath with overhead shower. The development further benefits from well-maintained communal grounds and ample communal parking, with management fees of c. 1,600 per annum.\n\nThis is an ideal opportunity for any buyer seeking a spacious, energy-efficient and well-maintained apartment in a highly convenient Balbriggan location. Early viewing is highly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0868323302 or 015411455 to arrange a viewing.\n\nKey Features\n• c.64 sq.m\n• BER B\n• Ground Floor Apartment\n• 2 Double Bedrooms\n• Fitted Wardrobes in Both Bedrooms\n• Turnkey Condition Throughout\n• Owner Occupied\n• No Onward Chain\n• Bright Open-Plan Kitchen/Living/Dining Area\n• Fully Fitted Kitchen\n• Electric Hob\n• Fully Tiled Bathroom\n• Bath with Overhead Shower\n• Laminate Flooring\n• Gas Fired Central Heating\n• Double Glazed Windows\n• Well Maintained Communal Grounds\n• Ample Communal Parking\n• Management Fee c. 1,600 Per Annum\n• Close to Balbriggan Town Centre\n• Easy Access to M1 and Transport Links\n• Ideal for First Time Buyers and Investors\n• Viewing Highly Advised\n\nDirections K32 DK07"
      },
      {
